<title>CHINA: SOCCER-WEAH LEADS WORLD ALL STARS TO VICTORY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-WEAH LEADS WORLD ALL STARS TO VICTORY.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG, July 3, Reuter - A World All Stars team beat the Asian All Stars 5-3 on Thursday in a match to celebrate the handover of Hong Kong to China.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>World All Stars - George Weah, Miguel Alfonso, Hakan Sukur, Claudio Reyna, Jean-Pierre Papin</p>
<p>Asian All Stars - Khodadad Azizi, Mohammed Salem Al Enazi, Karim Bagheri</p>
</text>
